  "details": "Sometimes during certain excitable situations, different group owners end up sending notifications to each other using group notifications. This can be funny for people who are participating in the events those notifications are about, but extremely annoying to people who are trying to do other things at the time, particularly when enjoying quiet company with others.\n\nHaving an option to mute all group notifications (ideally for a certain period of time) would be helpful. Currently users have to individually mute each group that is participating and then remember to unmute them all at a later time.\n\nThis would be similar to “focus time” or “do not disturb” on most current smartphones.",
